  "instructions": [
    "Heat oil in a large pot over medium heat.",
    "Add onion, garlic, and ginger, and saute until the onion is translucent.",
    "Add cumin powder, turmeric powder, salt, and black pepper, and stir for 1 minute.",
    "Add soaked and drained peas, tomato paste, and 2 cups of water, and bring to a boil.",
    "Reduce heat to low, cover, and simmer for 30 minutes or until the peas are tender.",
    "Use an immersion blender to puree the stew to desired consistency.",
    "Serve hot, garnished with chopped fresh cilantro.",
    "Refrigerate or freeze leftovers for up to 3 days.",
    "Reheat and serve.",
    "Garnish with additional cilantro if desired."
